.TH DWGFILTER "1" "November 2026" "dwgfilter 0.14" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
dwgfilter \- manual page for dwgfilter 0.14
.SH DESCRIPTION
dwgfilter [OPTIONS...] dwgfile
.PP
Allow custom jq queries on a temporary JSON dump.
.PP
OPTIONS: \fB\-\-help\fR,\-\-version
.TP
\fB\-\-debug\fR
keep the tmp json
.TP
\fB\-i\fR
write back in\-place, with an updating JQ query
.TP
\&...
all other options are passed to jq. See 'man jq'
.PP
The jq query is a single argument, so quote it. With \fB\-i\fR it must
return the whole changed JSON.
.SH EXAMPLES
.IP
dwgfilter '[.OBJECTS[] | select(.entity) | .entity] | group_by(.) | map({(.[0]): length}) | add' example.dwg
dwgfilter '.OBJECTS[] | select(.object == "LAYER") | .name' example.dwg
dwgfilter '.OBJECTS[] | select(.entity == "CIRCLE") | [.handle, .center, .radius]' example.dwg
dwgfilter \-i '.HEADER.TEXTSIZE = 5' example.dwg
dwgfilter \-i 'del(.OBJECTS[] | select(.entity == "TEXT"))' example.dwg
